WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.368 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Here's what people
are talking about.

00:00:01.368 --> 00:00:02.902 align:start size:94% position:6%
President Trump
had a very good day.

00:00:02.902 --> 00:00:03.436 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
He's very proud.

00:00:03.436 --> 00:00:05.238 align:start size:94% position:6%
Republicans finally passed
his tax bill,

00:00:05.238 --> 00:00:07.307 align:start size:94% position:6%
which means Trump's
about to sign his first

00:00:07.307 --> 00:00:09.376 line:92%
major piece of legislation.

00:00:09.376 --> 00:00:11.411 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yep, his chest
was puffed out so far,

00:00:11.411 --> 00:00:13.947 align:start size:94% position:6%
his tie was actually
at normal length.

00:00:13.947 --> 00:00:15.782 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:15.782 --> 00:00:18.051 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Wow.
It's actually at my waist.

00:00:18.051 --> 00:00:21.354 align:start size:94% position:6%
Amazing.
Normally, it's down there.

00:00:21.354 --> 00:00:22.622 line:92%
I can actually hold water --

00:00:22.622 --> 00:00:24.324 line:92%
I can drink water with one hand.

00:00:24.324 --> 00:00:26.826 align:start size:94% position:6%
I don't feel like tweeting.
I'm a new man."

00:00:26.826 --> 00:00:28.228 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:28.228 --> 00:00:29.095 line:92%
But Trump was very happy.

00:00:29.095 --> 00:00:31.064
He said,
"We are now pouring rocket fuel

00:00:31.064 --> 00:00:32.565 line:92%
into the engine of our economy."

00:00:32.565 --> 00:00:35.201
And if you've ever poured rocket
fuel into a regular engine,

00:00:35.201 --> 00:00:38.104 align:start size:94% position:6%
you know, it ruins the engine,
but still -- still, I --

00:00:38.104 --> 00:00:43.076 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:43.076 --> 00:00:44.477 align:start size:94% position:6%
There's been
a lot of criticism.

00:00:44.477 --> 00:00:47.147 align:start size:94% position:6%
I read that
only 24% of Americans

00:00:47.147 --> 00:00:49.849 line:92%
think the GOP tax plan is good.

00:00:49.849 --> 00:00:50.917 line:92%
To put that in perspective,

00:00:50.917 --> 00:00:54.587 align:start size:94% position:6%
the Spice Girls movie
got a 29% on Rotten Tomatoes.

00:00:54.587 --> 00:00:57.724 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:57.724 --> 00:00:59.893 align:start size:94% position:6%
I loved it.
-I love it.

00:00:59.893 --> 00:01:01.895 align:start size:94% position:6%
-House Minority Leader
Nancy Pelosi said

00:01:01.895 --> 00:01:04.731
that the tax plan
is an all-out looting of America

00:01:04.731 --> 00:01:07.434 size:84% position:42%
and a wholesale robbery
of the middle class.

00:01:07.434 --> 00:01:10.470
Which incidentally is also
the slogan for Whole Foods.

00:01:10.470 --> 00:01:11.704 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Really?
-Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:01:11.704 --> 00:01:12.405 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:12.405 --> 00:01:16.242 align:start size:94% position:6%
"It's organic applesauce!"
[ Laughter ]

00:01:16.242 --> 00:01:19.112 align:start size:94% position:6%
-$17?
-"It knows three languages."

00:01:19.112 --> 00:01:20.847 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:20.847 --> 00:01:22.449 line:92%
I'd pay 30 bucks for that.

00:01:22.449 --> 00:01:25.418
University of Pennsylvania,
which is Trump's alma mater,

00:01:25.418 --> 00:01:28.988 align:start size:94% position:6%
says the tax bill
will add $2.2 trillion

00:01:28.988 --> 00:01:30.023 size:78% position:39% line:92%
to the national debt.

00:01:30.023 --> 00:01:31.658 align:start size:94% position:6%
Trump was like, "Come on.
Are you gonna really believe

00:01:31.658 --> 00:01:34.260 align:start size:94% position:6%
a school that let me graduate?
Give me a break, come on."

00:01:34.260 --> 00:01:35.328 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:35.328 --> 00:01:39.732 size:84% position:42% line:92%
Now all of a sudden..."

00:01:39.732 --> 00:01:43.436
And people are still talking
about this Pentagon UFO program.

00:01:43.436 --> 00:01:45.772
And Sarah Huckabee Sanders
said that she'd have to check

00:01:45.772 --> 00:01:48.942 align:start size:94% position:6%
with the President
to see if he believes in UFOs.

00:01:48.942 --> 00:01:49.576 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Light laughter ]

00:01:49.576 --> 00:01:51.144 align:start size:94% position:6%
But she got her answer
when she saw Trump

00:01:51.144 --> 00:01:54.481
wearing a tinfoil hat that said
"Make Earth Great Again."

00:01:54.481 --> 00:01:55.715 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:55.715 --> 00:02:00.520 line:92%
"Take me to your leader."

00:02:00.520 --> 00:02:02.322 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-[ Laughing ]

00:02:02.322 --> 00:02:03.990 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
"Wall-E"

00:02:03.990 --> 00:02:05.225 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-"Wall-E."

00:02:05.225 --> 00:02:07.227 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:07.227 --> 00:02:07.894 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Check this out.

00:02:07.894 --> 00:02:10.063 size:88% position:44%
Google says that some of
the years most popular

00:02:10.063 --> 00:02:14.467 align:start size:94% position:6%
"how to" searches were "How
to make solar eclipse glasses"

00:02:14.467 --> 00:02:16.402 align:start size:94% position:6%
and "How to buy Bitcoin."
-Oh.

00:02:16.402 --> 00:02:19.439
-They also released a
least-popular "how to" searches.

00:02:19.439 --> 00:02:22.308
These are things that basically
no one searched for all year.

00:02:22.308 --> 00:02:24.077
They're pretty interesting.
I'll show you what I mean.

00:02:24.077 --> 00:02:26.946 align:start size:94% position:6%
For example,
only three people searched for

00:02:26.946 --> 00:02:29.315 align:start size:94% position:6%
"How to find out
if Papa John is single."

00:02:29.315 --> 00:02:31.618 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Wow.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:31.618 --> 00:02:35.321 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Only three people.
-Three people.

00:02:35.321 --> 00:02:36.689 line:92%
-Only two people searched for

00:02:36.689 --> 00:02:39.359 size:88% position:44%
"How to watch longer ads
before YouTube videos."

00:02:39.359 --> 00:02:39.792 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Oh, wow.

00:02:39.792 --> 00:02:41.828 align:start size:94% position:6%
-People want to see more
before their video.

00:02:41.828 --> 00:02:43.830 size:75% position:38%
-Yeah, I want the ad
to be longer, too.

00:02:43.830 --> 00:02:46.733 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And finally,
only one person searched for

00:02:46.733 --> 00:02:47.600 line:92%
"How to extend my Uber ride

00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:49.769 align:start size:94% position:6%
so my driver
can finish his life story."

00:02:49.769 --> 00:02:50.470 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:50.470 --> 00:02:55.441 align:start size:94% position:6%
"No, keep talking.
I want to hear more."

00:02:55.441 --> 00:02:58.811 align:start size:94% position:6%
You guys, we're just five days
away from Christmas.

00:02:58.811 --> 00:03:00.647 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's right, yeah,
you can be excited.

00:03:00.647 --> 00:03:01.548 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:01.548 --> 00:03:05.652 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm psyched.
Five days away.

00:03:05.652 --> 00:03:06.352 size:78% position:39% line:92%
But did you see this?

00:03:06.352 --> 00:03:09.522 align:start size:94% position:6%
Rome's official Christmas tree
is being mocked

00:03:09.522 --> 00:03:12.091 align:start size:94% position:6%
because it lost
a lot of its needles.

00:03:12.091 --> 00:03:13.560 align:start size:94% position:6%
Did you see the photo?
This is real.

00:03:13.560 --> 00:03:15.261 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is from Rome.
Take a look.

00:03:15.261 --> 00:03:16.029 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Oh, boy, yeah.

00:03:16.029 --> 00:03:16.930 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Audience "Awws" ]
Yeah.

00:03:16.930 --> 00:03:19.265 align:start size:94% position:6%
Even Charlie Brown was like,
"What the hell is that?"

00:03:19.265 --> 00:03:21.034 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:21.034 --> 00:03:22.569 size:81% position:41% line:92%
It's a Christmas tree.

00:03:22.569 --> 00:03:27.106
And, finally, I saw that there's
now a NORAD Santa Tracker app,

00:03:27.106 --> 00:03:28.107 size:81% position:41% line:92%
so you can watch Santa

00:03:28.107 --> 00:03:30.476 align:start size:94% position:6%
travel all over the world
on your phone.

00:03:30.476 --> 00:03:32.412 align:start size:94% position:6%
Sounds like a great idea
until Mrs. Claus sees

00:03:32.412 --> 00:03:35.014 align:start size:94% position:6%
Santa's been at the same house
for over an hour.

00:03:35.014 --> 00:03:36.049 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:36.049 --> 00:03:38.017 size:84% position:42% line:92%
"We were just talking!"

00:03:38.017 --> 00:03:39.619 line:92%
We have a great show tonight.

00:03:39.619 --> 00:03:41.421 line:92%
Give it up for The Roots!

